    \item \textbf{Chen, F., et al. (2020)}. Blockchain for Internet of Things applications: A review and open issues. \textit{Journal of Network and Computer Applications, 173}, 102854. \url{https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jnca.2020.102854}
    
    \textbf{Annotation:} This paper reviews recent advances in employing blockchain technology to develop more reliable Internet of Things (IoT) systems. It categorizes the research into four distinct roles of blockchain within IoT: access control platform, data security platform, trusted third party, and automatic payment platform, while discussing the future challenges associated with each role.

